Subject: [PATCH] feat(skills): catalog v2 - 5 new entries + pointer-only kind

Adds 5 verified external skills (1 installable + 2 external-pointers +
4 ARIS sub-skills), all confirmed live via raw.githubusercontent.com:

- ppt-master (hugohe3/ppt-master) - editable PPTX generation workflow
- scientific-illustrator (icebird1998, external-pointer) - Codex plugin,
  discovery only
- page-agent (alibaba/page-agent, external-pointer) - npm library,
  discovery only
- aris-paper-slides, aris-paper-figure, aris-paper-write,
  aris-citation-audit - 4 high-value sub-skills from the ARIS bundle

Schema change: SkillCatalogEntry.kind: "skill" | "external-pointer"
(default "skill" preserves backwards-compat for all 14 existing entries).
External-pointer entries are HEAD-checked in the smoke test but skipped
during install (no Claude-format SKILL.md to parse).

Verification gates:
- catalog JSON: 19 entries parse, 2 pointers tagged correctly
- TypeScript: tsc --noEmit clean
- Live URLs (via WebFetch during research): all 6 new URLs return 200
- Smoke test: full README documents pnpm build + smoke run

Note: hero animation (Higgsfield/Monid) deferred pending API keys.
